      "text": "A table titled \"EPI: Open vial wastage rate - this and last 5 years\" for Trainingland, one row per vaccine and one column per year; the year headings are too blurred to read. Four columns hold data. BCG runs 5.9, 6.5, 5.9, 5.9; DPT-HepB-Hib 4.5, 4.5, 4.7, 4.1; IPV 19.9, 14.7, 3, then a negative value (-4); OPV 6, 6.2, 6.6, 6.3; PCV 5.7, 6.4, 6.2, 6.3; RV 6.1, 6.3, 5.9, 6.4; TT 5.9, 5.7, 5.8, 6.3. The MR and yellow fever rows are empty.",
